MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 20, 2022
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-5-23 for Bulk Fertilizer Application, for the City of
Cheyenne Parks Division
______________________________________________
Bid #E-5-23 was solicited for Bulk Fertilizer Application, for the City of Cheyenne Parks Division.
The scope of the project is for application of 44,000 pounds of fertilizer, over approximately 250
acres (project sites included)

One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bid was received
from:
1. AgFinity Inc. Brighton, Colorado.

The bids were reviewed by Brandon Peterson (CRE - Parks), and Jason Sanchez (CRE), and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from AgFinity Inc in an amount not to
exceed $39,160.00.

Funding:
001-17-1750-45-21601 (50%) (General Fund / Maintenance) / $19,580.00

014-17-1722-45-21601 (40%)  (Recreation Fund / Maintenance) $15,664.00

020-26-2614-45-43954 (10%)  (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Right of Way Operating Costs-
G&F) $3,916.00
